  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a terracotta pot over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, sauté until fragrant.",
    "Pour in ground turkey and cook until browned.",
    "Add rice noodles and stir to coat with oil and aromatics.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and water, bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add sweet chili sauce and reduce the mixture until it thickens and the noodles are tender.",
    "Stir in sliced green onions and cook for another minute.",
    "Serve hot straight from the terracotta pot.",
    "Garnish with additional green onions if desired."
